  "definition": "Content and Maintenance of Accounting Records",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-12-01",
  "historyNote": "#1838, eff 10-19-81; ss by #2206, eff 12-12-82; ss by #2541, eff 11-22-83; ss by #4707, eff 11-21-89; ss by #5301, eff 12-26-91; ss by #6662, eff 12-25-97; ss by #8526, eff 12-21-05; ss by #10536, eff 3-6-14 (from Rev 1005.01); ss by #10766, eff 1-22-15 (from Rev 1006.01); amd by #13049, eff 6-4-20 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 1000); ss by #13490, eff 11-15-22; ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1006.02) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
